Another benefit/hazard regarding cockatrices* is the ability to wield
them.  If wearing gloves and/or stoning resistant, a player or dungeon
denizen can wield the cockatrice* for the stoning effect.  Therefore,
it is not recommended to just leave cockatrice* corpses lying around.
